    H/TITLE SR00109C - OUTER CONTINENTAL SHELF LANDS ACT COVERAGE END
     *===============================================================*
     * WC000109C - Outer Continental Shelf Lands Act Coverage Endor. *
     *                                                               *
     * Program Description:                                          *
     *                                                               *
     *   Determines if this endorsement form should be attached to   *
     *   the policy and creates data in the Endorsement Form         *
     *   Workfile (WXFMP) prior to a form merge.                     *
     *                                                               *
     * Created   : 11/12/14                                          *
     * Programmer: C: 282                                            *
     * Project   : WC2318                                            *
     *===============================================================*
     * REVISIONS:                                                    *
     *                                                               *
      * 10/18/22 C:333 Project : WC2834 (Recompile)                   *
      *                Endorsement Recognition of Cancellation        *
     *                                                               *
      * 01/04/17 C:180 Project SY371 scriptura.                       *
      *                Add Scriptura interface.                       *
      *                                                               *
     * ------------------------------------------------------------- *
     *  NOTE: Please add comments to the top of revisions.           *
     * ------------------------------------------------------------- *
     *===============================================================*
     * Notes:                                                        *
     *                                                               *
     *  Utilizes the endorsement copybook (SCOPYEN01F/I/C).          *
     *                                                               *
     *  QQMODE = 1 - Called to determine if form should be attached. *
     *  QQMODE = 2 - Called to print endorsement.                    *
     *  QQMODE = 3 - Called for additional input.                    *
     *  QQMODE = 4 - Called for mid-term processing.                 *
     *===============================================================*
     ** Copybook F specs
     F/COPY SCOPYEN01F
     ** Additional Information File
     Fwxfmp1    if   e           k disk    usropn
     F                                     rename(pfm01:pfm02)
     *=========================================================================
     *  Definition Specs
     *=========================================================================
     D SR00109C        PR
     D                                3
     D                                3
     D                                9
     D                                5
     D                                3
     D                                1
     D qqRRN                          9  0
     D qqMod2                         1
     D SR00109C        PI
     D  qqco#                         3
     D  qqfnd                         3
     D  qqemp#                        9
     D  qqdiv                         5
     D  qqfyr                         3
     D  qqmode                        1
     D  qqrrn                         9  0
     D  qqmod2                        1
     ** Copybook D specs
     D/COPY SCOPYEN01D
     *=========================================================================
     *  /COPY required constants
     *=========================================================================
     ** Form ID
     D QQFORM          S             15A   inz('WC000109C ')
     ** Additional entry program
     D addpgm          c                   const('SR00109CI ')
     *=========================================================================
     *  PLIST definitions
     *=========================================================================
     *=========================================================================
     *  KLIST definitions
     *=========================================================================
     ** Additional Input file
     C     fmky3         klist
     C                   kfld                    xxco#
     C                   kfld                    xxfnd
     C                   kfld                    xxfyr
     C                   kfld                    xxemp#
     C                   kfld                    xxdiv
     C                   kfld                    xxform
     *=========================================================================
     *  Main
     *=========================================================================
     ** Copybook C specs
     C/COPY SCOPYEN01C
     *=========================================================================
     *  OTHINF - Subroutine to load form specific information & write record
     *=========================================================================
     C     othinf        begsr
     *
     C                   open      wxfmp1
     C     fmky3         chain     pfm02                              60
     *
     ** Move the custom fields to print
     C                   movel     f3c401        fmc401
     C                   movel     f3c402        fmc402
     C                   movel     f3c403        fmc403
     C                   movel     f3c404        fmc404
     C                   movel     f3c405        fmc405
     ** Write the output record
     C                   close     wxfmp1
     *
     C                   endsr
     *=========================================================================
     *  PGMSTR - Beginning of program processing
     *=========================================================================
     C     pgmstr        begsr
     C                   endsr
     *=========================================================================
     *  PGMEND - End of program processing
     *=========================================================================
     C     pgmend        begsr
     C                   endsr
     *=========================================================================
     *  VALID - Subroutine to attach this form to the policy
     *=========================================================================
     C     valid         begsr
     C                   move      *on           crtfrm
     C                   endsr
